{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "FLUX.3 Klein Edit",
    "description": "Instruction edit via ReferenceMultiLatent (source image as VAE reference, latent sized to it, 1 MP). Official ComfyUI base edit template settings: 50 steps, CFG 1, euler/simple. Write the finished image, not the change, and address the source as <ref_image_0>. REQUIRES (gated, accept the BFL license on HF first): black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-bf16.safetensors (the base checkpoint), saved as diffusion_models/flux3_image_klein_bf16.safetensors, plus text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors (CLIP type flux3) and vae/flux2-vae.safetensors from the same repo. bf16 on Apple Silicon (int8_convrot/nvfp4 are CUDA paths). The official template runs the Qwen3.5 9B prompt upsampler first; this graph skips it, so write a full scene caption (subject, framing, background, lighting)."
